If the number is divisible by 2 then it will divide it by two each time. Otherwise it will multiply it by three and add one. It will keep doing this for as long as the number is not equal to 1 or 4. Once it hits 1 or 4 it exits out of the loop and prints the amount of times it took to get down to that value.

