        if ((y & BigInteger.ONE).equals(BigInteger.ZERO)) {
          // Even exponent. Multiply into running product.
          result = result.multiply(x);
          y = y >> 1;
        } else {
          // Odd exponent. Square into running product.
          result = result.multiply(result).mod(MODULO_PRIME);
          --y;
        }
        if (y.equals(BigInteger.ZERO)) break;
        x = x.square().mod(MODULO_PRIME);
      }
      return result;
    }
    ```

